                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="ATQMRgmmLwmYR5vOms3V-26" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;roundedPerimeter=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(39, 38, 48); font-family: Consolas, Courier New, monospace; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: 19px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Scribbl Week&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Write it, Schedule it, Done.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;This project aims to be a service that allows users save personal or &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;professional notes and tie them to there calendar with email based alerts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;as well as plan schedules and projects, all saved to a postgreSQL database&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="170" width="700" x="550" y="270" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="IsBv-5l9G0VolknDQybY-1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;roundedPerimeter=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;1. Are there at least two roles with different rights? &lt;br&gt;P: yes one is a planner and other is participatent&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;J: Yes, one is an organiser and other is a subscriber&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. Are there three related resources, or three lists? &lt;br&gt;P: not sure what is meant here but if it means like database tables then i believe we currently would have a user data table, a notes data table tied to user and a schedule data table tied to user&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;J: we have workspace table,user table,event table&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. Is there a rule the server must enforce (capacity, dates, ownership…)?&lt;br&gt;P: user own there own notes (not sure im answering this correctly), is sending email alerts based on&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);&quot;&gt;schedules&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;users opted into or user set alerts an enforcement of dates ?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;J:User sign in and sign up , otp into schedule via invite link&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="390" width="1015" x="275" y="820" as="geometry"/>
